  "scope": "Visible controls and selectors observed through the accessibility bridge on an enrolled work-profile test child. Actions describe the supported capability for the selector; not every control was individually clicked. This is UI control/selector evidence, not Firebase parity. Dynamic text (child name, timestamps, amounts, counts and saved item names) is described rather than copied from private data.",
